:{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fixed\",\"flexSize\":\"100%\"}},\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">Servizi</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"var:preset|spacing|10\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;height:var(--wp--preset--spacing--10)\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Stilismo Personale</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lavora uno a uno con i nostri stilisti esperti per creare outfit che si allineano al tuo gusto unico, tipo di corpo e stile di vita.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"56px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:56px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Rinfresco dell\'armadio</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rinnova il tuo guardaroba. I nostri stilisti ti aiuteranno a liberarti del superfluo, organizzare e aggiornare il tuo armadio con nuovi pezzi freschi.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Modifiche e sartoria</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Assicurati la vestibilità perfetta. Dalla cucitura all\'adattamento, i nostri sarti esperti modelleranno i tuoi capi alla perfezione.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"56px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:56px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}},\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Shopping Virtuale</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Non riesci a venire nel nostro negozio? Il nostro servizio di assistenza allo shopping virtuale ti permette di fare acquisti comodamente da casa tua.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"calc( 0.25 * var(\\u002d\\u002dwp\\u002d\\u002dstyle\\u002d\\u002droot\\u002d\\u002dpadding-right, var(\\u002d\\u002dwp\\u002d\\u002dcustom\\u002d\\u002dgap\\u002d\\u002dhorizontal)))\"} -->\n<div styl